    "Adds integration test coverage for several previously uncovered outbound connection management features merged over the years: extra full outbound connections due to a stale tip (#11560), periodic block-relay-only connections (#19858), and full outbound connection network diversification (#27213).",
    "Deduplicates 100+ lines of custom SOCKS5 connection interception logic in `p2p_private_broadcast.py` (introduced in #29415) into reusable framework methods."
